1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,160
Nicholas II became ruler of Russia in 1894 and immediately told his advisors he had no idea how to run a country.

2
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:09,320
He said he wasn't prepared and didn't want the job.

3
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,760
His advisors told him to keep that to himself.

4
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:15,480
Twenty four years later, he and his entire family were executed in a basement.

5
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:18,720
Three hundred years of Romanov rule ended in about 10 minutes.

6
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:22,120
That's in a history book almost nobody reads past the opening chapters.

7
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:26,720
So a team of ex-Ivy League engineers built something that looks exactly like your social feed.

8
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,480
Same scroll, same dopamine.

9
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:31,080
But every post is a real story from history.

10
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:36,000
Human, surprising, impossible to forget, condensed into something you can actually keep.

11
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,880
People say they started seeing historical figures as actual people, not statues.

12
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,880
And they always had something worth saying.

13
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:42,880
Tri-paladin.

